---
description: Conventions for the test suite
globs: tests/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use `tmp_path` for anything touching the filesystem; never write into the
  repository during a test.
- Build feed payloads as byte literals in the test module rather than loading
  fixtures from disk — the payloads are short and the indirection costs more
  than it saves.
- Never hit the network. `fetch()` takes an injectable client for that reason.
